Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, she managed to launch some kind of\Nintense psychological attack on my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's more of a curse that makes\Neveryone in her vicinity act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a type of charm, then, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:01:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psychological attacks\Ndon't tend to work on me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I've trained a\Nlong time to prevent that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's impossible to ignore that my general
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awareness of you has\Nbeen greatly enhanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you care for a piece of candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sharing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop kidding yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though unintentional,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot turn a blind eye to a\Npsychological attack on my person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you help me with this, then just\Nlike that, you'll be declared innocent.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.79,0:02:28.04,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H4854E7&\3c&H4854E7&\fs200\bord8\fsp3\blur0.75\fnSweet Saturday\pos(982.31,466.84)\alpha&H00&}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(332,333,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(666,667,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(999,1000,\alpha&H00&)}t
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.79,0:02:28.04,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H60F3F2&\3c&H4854E7&\fs200\bord0\fsp3\blur0.75\fnSweet Saturday\pos(982.31,466.84)\alpha&H00&}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(332,333,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(666,667,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(999,1000,\alpha&H00&)}t
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please try to think of it\Nas a simple assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong, aren't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.42,0:02:34.42,That,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H60F3F2&\3c&H4854E7&\fs200\bord8\fsp3\blur0.75\fnSweet Saturday\pos(982.31,466.84)\alpha&H00&}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(332,333,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(666,667,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(999,1000,\alpha&H00&)}s
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.42,0:02:34.42,That,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H60F3F2&\3c&H4854E7&\fs200\bord0\fsp3\blur0.75\fnSweet Saturday\pos(982.31,466.84)\alpha&H00&}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(332,333,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(666,667,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(999,1000,\alpha&H00&)}s
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you did defeat this, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been calling me this and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe use my name instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a little hard to\Nremember such a long name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give you a nickname, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel about Schwa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only just met, but we're\Nclose enough to his nicknames.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that she feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Setting aside this unimportant matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it is not unimportant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should give you another\Noverview of what we're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recently, along the roads in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a suit of living armor is reported\Nto have been robbing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We deployed a suppression team, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were unfortunately found\Nstripped of all their belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were stripped of their belongings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.23,0:03:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, every single\None of them was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, though, there\Nhaven't been any fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's much danger, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.86,0:03:40.86,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H0B0A0A&}m 275 315 l 543 315 543 401 275 401
