Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The party!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that our target?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've such strong magical\Npower. Leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's my turn to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really planning to use\Nthat sword in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest will be completely\Nlaid bare. And if anyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here foraging for edible\Nplants they'll be cut in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon to be lured in by\Nthe sword's destructive power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that men should use their own\Nnatural abilities in a challenge. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And up till this moment, I've always\Nfought with this sword still sheathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now let's go, Gram!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even compared to the knights of our\Nland, his technique is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stand back! It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.99,0:05:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Wait! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living armor requires\Nmagic in order to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was obviously after\Nthe magic and the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it speaks human language.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living armor is a magic weapon\Nthat can move autonomously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of one with a\Nmechanism to have a person inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Audrey, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's after that tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:06:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks! You saved my butt! Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to lose the ability to walk\Naround freely, but I have to ditch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, interrogator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you'd tell\Nme your annual income.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My annual income?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm afraid it's of\Nthe utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's\Na need to go into my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My salary is 100 gold coins annually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand now, don't you Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As shocking as this may be,\Non your head, you're wearing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three years worth of a\Ngovernment workers salary
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth three years of their salary?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a working adult, their turn of\Nphrase has a very harsh ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, defeat that thing! Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a surprisingly\Nbackhanded way to raise morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just darting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used enough strength\Nto pierce through steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be living armor,\Nbut it won't be unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This armor is made of magical\Nsteel, forged using ancient methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magical power from the\Noutside is absorbed or
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deflected and it\Nautomatically repairs itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you're an ancient weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be afraid, human children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Viz, the incomparably skilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the top officers\Nof the Demon Lord's army.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.03,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,0)\c&H0605F4&\fnPainted Lady\fs100\bord6\blur6\3c&H0605F4&\pos(958.13,159.37)\1a&HFF&\fax0.2}Vizzd the Incomparably Skilled
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.03,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,0)\c&HEAEAEC&\3c&HF7E5F8&\fnPainted Lady\fs100\bord2\blur1\pos(958.13,159.37)\1a&HFF&\fax0.2}Vizzd the Incomparably Skilled
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.03,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,0)\c&H030305&\fnPainted Lady\fs100\bord0\blur1\3c&HEAEAEC&\pos(958.13,159.37)\fax0.2}Vizzd the Incomparably Skilled
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.89,0:07:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of their top officers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incomparably skilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viz, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, but how can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chair I see in your\Neyes is truly gratifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, are you actually a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for assuming you\Nwere a guy, until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's the way I choose\Nto carry myself after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drape this over you for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to act as a decoy. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe its only goal\Nis to amass magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, I'll be naked. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fine at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you do something\Nabout this, Jango G?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the interrogator\Nwill end up naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please! Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please marry me, my beautiful Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to save the world for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what children!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it feel like everyone's under\Nsome kind of curse to say that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just put that on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sit over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't withstand it feels\Nlike my mind is about to break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sitting off to the side\Nand I'm not showing any skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now could you do the thing, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The jacket's on, just like I instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this Tachibana is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how can I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to calm myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sort of floaty and fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this feeling?
