Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to ignore me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Armor Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That profound feeling you're experiencing\Nright now actually has a name.
