Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it this thing is really a nuisance\Nyou make a mockery of me if you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would prefer for me to hunt you\Ndown, then I shall do exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a boyfriend shirt what a\Nridiculous idea no interest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fact that anyone assumes\Ni'm a man who would be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swayed by such a thing is abominable.\NRectify this, Tachibana! Look, Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't change the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's being said that I'm a man of\Nchildish taste and that really irks me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine, but seriously\Nthough, are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,compared to your interest\Nin funny girls and maids,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.91,0:11:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to think my tastes are a\Nlittle more in the realm of normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's okay for you to\Nmock someone's preferences?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this endless darting around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't knock it\Nbefore you try it, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you imagine it\Nwith me as your model?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunny girl, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunny. A bunny?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.57,Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\fnFree Pixel\b1\c&HFFE1E1&\fs15\blur0.7\frz12.49\fax0.02\pos(1049.25,54.78)}C{*\fax0.022}h{*\fax0.023}a{*\fax0.025}r{*\fax0.027}m{*\fax0.028}e{\fax0.03}d
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what about bunny girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think something so simple\Nwill make my heart dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a maid uniform, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bet you'd like the\Ntype with long skirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a direct hit and a blow\Nfrom my axe are ineffective,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then absorb magical power\Nand focus into boosters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reinforce joints and\Nincrease physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full sec mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long-skirted maid uniform. Look.
