Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THIS IS BAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the whole welcome\Nhome master thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous to think\Nthat one would automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call someone they've only just met master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so condescending to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a really annoying habit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad habit or not, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's your fault for doing\Nsuch stupid things all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not to shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shut up!
