Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, Moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all this time, I thought the\NDemon Lord was just a story for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:14:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you show up here saying you've brought\Nin one of the Demon Lord's top officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually find this turn of events\Ndifficult to believe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, don't let it\Nget to your heads, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get beat into a bloody pulp\Nwhen my comrades come and rescue me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that will be the end of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's big talk from somebody who's\Nhogtied and waiting to be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you actually have comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the numbers, how many do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite the lively one,\NVizzd, the incomparably skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that tingled a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bear a grudge for my ripped clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her face is scary, and I am afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is an interrogator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I weren't in this form, you wouldn't\Neven be drawing breath right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is this demon lord or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a top officer, you\Nmust at least know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know where the demon lord is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, so you lot haven't even\Nrealized the truth yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's certainly convenient for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to gather more\Nmagic before the hero appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're saying that you believe that a\Nhero has not yet appeared in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you are sorely mistaken, Vizzd. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am here. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Schwarz von\NLiechtenstein-Lohengrom, am he,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hero who has been\Nsummoned here to battle you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no freaking way a person\Nas boring as you could be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WHY WON'T ANYONE IN\NTHIS WORLD BELIEVE ME?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you know it's a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,willingly giving the opposition\Ninformation is the lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my allies hate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone please get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too much of a racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're interfering with my work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, whatcha think's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang it, putting me\Nthrough all that torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The core of my body is still\Nbuzzing and tingling like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't land even one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry up and get out of here so\NI can start gathering more magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't see a way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imprisoned in a sad little cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viz the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt the Demon Lord will be inclined\Nto overlook this blunder. Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that I'll be praised by\Nthe Demon Lord for trying so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've gotten my hands\Non some good information!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hero has already come to our world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard that from the\Nshadows, but I'm sure he's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems like a background character.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you little!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were there, you\Nshould have rescued me early?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stupid four-eyed jerk once\Nmy magic has fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will exact my revenge for\Nwhat he's done to my armor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the one of the glasses did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better believe the next time we do\Nbattle, I'm a thousand percent going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, please don't have\Na tantrum right in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M NOT HAVING A TANTRUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A VERY GOOD MORNING TO\NYOU, BEAUTIFUL AUDREY!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, could it be that you're\Nstill wearing your nightclothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't really conceal the fact that it\Nwas one of my goals to see that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you are still here in your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered if we might go\Nhave our breakfast together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I had that thought, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hello there, Father. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this doing here? A door?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello, it's Schwartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my hands full right\Nnow, but come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, this is the ability I\Nreceived from that crappy goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means this is your house Watanabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be more that you would\Nlive sort of like steeped in darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is pretty boring. Well, I'm\Nsorry. It's so disappointing. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your house Audrey. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All mine That's interesting\Ncuz there are things
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that make it feel a bit\Nmore like a man lives here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwartz, you should brace yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or I think the time has come for me to\Ntell you an incredibly painful truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, did you both sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'd like to thank\Nyou for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.43,0:19:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first love!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my first love, and yet, Hinata\NTachibana is a 32-year-old office worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also a dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I've stolen a\Nyoung man's first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am a wicked, wicked woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old are you anyway, Schwa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it written down\Nsomewhere in your stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a senior in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly do you mean by stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She got away, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, with this method of escape, I don't\Nknow how it could have been prevented.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've learned no more\Nabout the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she were capable of something\Nlike this she would have done it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,earlier i think we should Assume\Nan ally came to help her i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd be able to gather information\Nin a large town like This i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.37,0:19:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see how anyone the only thing\Nwe've seen to learn is that no one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knows anything and it Seems that\Nthe demon lord is known here only
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through folk tales would it be best\Nto travel To an even larger town
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to investigate hey tachibana i had\Nno idea this existed it's handy
