Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you You can see the strength\Nof the opponent you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you're basically cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I got going for me is how cute I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.19,0:20:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So protect me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as good at making\Nfriends as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy doesn't put up\Nany psychological walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never live that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always surrounded by people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, you're too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've remembered all the way\Nback to something unpleasant.
