Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding your name like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's physically unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, physically unbearable?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, my name is Schwartz von Lichtenstein,\NLohengramm. Understand? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I honestly don't care\Nthat much, so whatever you want.
